<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>AVHAN Creative Solutions</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
    body { background: #0b0f1a; color: #fff; line-height: 1.6; }
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f2027, #203a43, #2c5364);
      padding: 80px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 { font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 700; }
    header p { margin-top: 15px; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #cfd9df; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 14px 34px;
      background: #00c6ff;
      color: #000;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .btn:hover { background: #00a2d6; }
    section { padding: 70px 20px; max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; }
    .section-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px; }
    .section-title h2 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    .section-title p { color: #9aa5b1; margin-top: 10px; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 25px; }
    .card {
      background: #131a2a;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      transition: 0.3s;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    .card:hover { transform: translateY(-8px); }
    .card h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .card p { color: #b8c2cc; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    footer {
      background: #080c14;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>AVHAN Creative Solutions</h1>
  <p>Game Development & Digital Creative Studio</p>
  <a href="#services" class="btn">Explore Our Work</a>
</header>

<section id="about">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>Kami menghadirkan solusi kreatif berbasis teknologi dan game modern</p>
  </div>
  <p style="text-align:center; max-width:800px; margin:auto; color:#cbd5e1;">
    AVHAN Creative Solutions adalah studio kreatif digital yang berfokus pada pengembangan game,
    aplikasi interaktif, dan produk digital inovatif. Kami menggabungkan kreativitas, teknologi,
    dan pengalaman pengguna untuk menghasilkan karya yang modern dan berkualitas.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="services">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Our Services</h2>
    <p>Layanan utama yang kami tawarkan</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>🎮 Game Development</h3>
      <p>Pembuatan game mobile dan desktop dengan desain modern dan performa optimal.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>💻 Digital Products</h3>
      <p>Pengembangan produk digital seperti asset game, tools, dan aplikasi kreatif.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>🎨 Creative Design</h3>
      <p>UI/UX design, branding, dan visual digital yang futuristik dan profesional.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <div class="section-title">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Siap berkolaborasi dengan kami</p>
  </div>
  <p style="text-align:center; color:#cbd5e1;">
    Email: <b>avhan.creative@gmail.com</b><br>
    Instagram: <b>@avhancreative</b>
  </p>
</section>

<footer>
  © 2025 AVHAN Creative Solutions. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
